## What to carry forward

Exact localization is governed here by analytic continuation and injectivity, not invertibility alone. Approximate localization calls for quantitative propagation-of-smallness bounds and Hilbert-space geometry. The Gram determinant $\|u\|^2\|v\|^2-\langle u,vangle^2\geq0$ is the finite-dimensional companion behind many concentration inequalities.
